  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a thin square sheet of side $L$ and thickness $t$, made of a material of resistivity $\\rho$. The resistance between two opposite faces, shown by the shaded areas in the figure is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/jQWT8TUcKYNLj76kfHeUfDLbThIKMquc23PlGL0NDCw.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "GlS1v",
      "text": "\ndirectly proportional to $L$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZK54r",
      "text": "\ndirectly proportional to $t$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rYcLj",
      "text": "\nindependent of $L$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "TDJiD",
      "text": "\nindependent of $t$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$R=\\frac{\\rho(L)}{A}=\\frac{\\rho L}{t L}=\\frac{\\rho}{t}$ ie, $R$ is independent of $L$. Hence the correct option is (c).",
    "image": null
  },
